  "question": "Which hotel is closest in the forward direction toward Wayne County Museum, Goldsboro, NC from It's A Zoo Life, Macclesville, NC?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.67449 35.786787)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.992775 35.383236)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'hotel'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.67449 35.786787)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-77.67449 35.786787)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
